-- The referenda, motions and votes omniplex indexed from Nexus blocks 12135052 to 12335491, in
-- the shapes it writes them, for the API's integration test. The test creates the governance
-- tables from omniplex's migration first. Referenda 81 to 83 and the spends and delegations are
-- made up to cover states the indexed blocks never reached.

-- 81 was killed, which also clears its metadata. 82 is confirmed and waits for enactment. 83 is
-- deciding, with a delegation made after the indexed height omniplex last recorded.
-- The first delegation ended before 83 started but was in force when 79 and 80 were decided. The
-- second is in force now, from a block after the indexed height.
-- Spends in each state: a paid one stays open past its expiry until its payment is checked, an
-- approved one closes at its expiry, and a failed one can be paid again until then.
